sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Ag as Node agent
    participant GW as Ingest gateway
    participant K as Kafka
    participant IX as Indexer
    participant Hot as Hot tier
    participant Cold as Cold object store
    participant U as Engineer
    App->>Ag: write to stdout
    Ag->>Ag: tail, parse, add pod and node labels
    Ag->>GW: compressed batch
    GW->>K: produce, partitioned by tenant
    K->>IX: consume
    IX->>Hot: build inverted index
    Note over IX,Hot: searchable within the 60s SLO
    IX->>Cold: roll sealed segments off
    U->>Hot: query last 24h
    Hot-->>U: results
    U->>Cold: query older range
    Cold-->>U: rehydrated results, slower
